{"version":1,"key":"card:675","content":{"id":675,"content":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"nonce","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"integrity","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 是用于增强 Web 安全两个属性：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5eb98f78-410e-45ba-a05f-953847cb5bdf","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"nonce","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 全称 Number used ONCE（一次性数字），是一种白名单机制来防止 XSS 攻击","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"fa38e864-90bb-4fc1-89e0-b7853ca3e512","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"如果没有 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"nonce","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，那么攻击者注入的内联 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"script","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 脚本即可任意执行，为了防止内联脚本执行，只要​","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"不在","type":"formatted"},{"text":" CSP 中设置 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"unsafe-url","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 即可，那么任何内联脚本都会被禁止执行，这样虽然解决了 XSS 的内联脚本执行，但是某些场景下需要动态生成内联脚本，自己生成的脚本也无法执行了。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0e2585bc-611e-4122-a52b-eda7849b4d95","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"为了解决这个问题，可以使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"nonce","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 属性。具体办法是在生成内联脚本时，同时生成一次性（每次都要动态生成，不能相同）的随机字符串，并且设置为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"script","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 标签的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"nonce","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 属性，并且在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Content-Security-Policy","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 指定","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"70e4f142-13cc-4cb8-bcca-10874e26ce43","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<script nonce=\"R4nd0mStr1ng\">\n  console.log(\"这段代码会被执行，因为 nonce 匹配\");\n</script>","collabId":"261c2304-2af6-473d-baeb-3b73506cc00a","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"abb66fc8-e593-4f47-9458-61018d461930","language":"HTML","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"7d7c8810-93d3-417a-800d-4af96783bd69"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"Content-Security-Policy: script-src ’nonce-R4nd0mStr1ng’","collabId":"de6eb623-af08-4371-9a32-6e946ed3fc0a","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"b05426b1-89f9-4ccc-a8a2-68324fe374bc","language":"HTTP","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"1585f9f8-3def-4392-9109-097330aae4df"},{"children":[{"text":"浏览器会对比标签上的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"nonce","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 属性和响应头的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"nonce","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，如果二者匹配，那么该脚本就可以被执行，否则就会被拦截。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5f1c73c9-cc2d-4a28-8b0c-86c57ec3af30","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"726cb9de-bccd-4958-b4b7-fd67a6252b5e","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"integrity","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 全称 Subresource Integrity (SRI，子资源完整性)，它的作用是防止第三方资源（如 CDN）被篡改","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5a212522-229f-4bf5-a011-f05f8b3058c7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"如果你引用第三方的 CDN 资源，如果该第三方网站被攻击，黑客替换了脚本内容，在此脚本中黑客即可为所欲为，如窃取数据，植入挖矿代码或者跳转到非法地址，带来财产和声誉上的损失。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a30b0875-df71-4008-b141-7180630ce0b5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"calloutType":"danger","children":[{"children":[{"text":"有一个亲身经历，在高德的 M 站中，为了开发调试，引用了线上的 CDN 资源，但是此 CDN 被黑客攻破，脚本内容被替换，如果用户从别的网站跳转到该网站，那么会自动跳转到一个赌博网站，此事不仅被 CEO 发现，而且还加班到凌晨四点才发现该问题并解决。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d9924f9d-72e1-476d-8e03-42a7b301738d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"27e61781-ccf7-4ee2-9f67-ca658c45e05c","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"危险","type":"callout"},{"children":[{"text":"为了保证我们引用的是正确的资源，我们可以在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"integrity","type":"formatted"},{"text":"指定资源的 hash 值，如果脚本被篡改，那么浏览器计算出的 hash 值就会与我们指定的不一样，那么就可以认为脚本被修改了，浏览器就会拒绝执行","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e1ece513-cbac-48ae-9237-2936ac0241e7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<script \n  src=\"https://example.com/example-framework.js\" \n  integrity=\"sha384-Li9vy3DqF8tnTXuiaAJuML3ky+er10rcgNR/A9W38174FqH7jNxk8+ul7jWd\" \n  crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n</script>","collabId":"4bcf56ed-d41a-400b-b4c1-9e23fc8b48ec","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"6d81ad1b-c537-4698-93ce-c6e4366738fc","language":"HTML","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"a94e20a1-de42-40a0-9c8c-e48b3124eba8"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"integrity","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的格式为加密哈希算法的前缀（如 sha256, sha384, sha512）和 Base64 编码的哈希值。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6c0164e3-7a73-4361-b8bd-0696670dc419","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"calloutType":"info","children":[{"children":[{"text":"由于浏览器需要读取文件内容，因此通常配合 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"crossorigin=\"anonymous\"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"987fe535-c4be-4cf0-a973-513ee8a4c2b1","contentId":5140,"contentTitle":"","contentType":"card","refId":674,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","type":"content-link"},{"text":" 属性，否则无法获取内容，导致验证失败，脚本无法执行。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a552246b-e64d-4426-9ac6-dde4a8078a96","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"edd0e3c0-9169-436c-9e84-a82f40fcdd50","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"信息","type":"callout"}],"collabId":"be436814-764b-4feb-8600-20796b897e4e","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"b6aea944-6a80-4ab7-aa6e-f2288e14f274","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"tags":["HTML/nonce","HTML/integrity","安全/CSP"],"createTime":1769096078276,"updateTime":1793532619573,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532619573},"links":{"card:674":{"key":"card:674","type":"card","id":674}}}